s</strong> in Agra. It is the perfect choice if you are travelling with your grand family or big friends group. Duracabs offers a wide range of AC and non-AC vehicles with many facilities such as ample legroom, comfortable seats, plus interiors and many more. Duracabs offers you a comfortable and luxurious ride.</p><h3><strong>Hire 18 Seater Tempo Traveller in Agra</strong></h3><p>While you hire an <strong>18 seater tempo traveller</strong> a large group of friends or a grand family don\'t need to travel in two separate vehicles. Duracabs offers a very spacious accommodations which can carry around 20+ passengers. These tempo travellers can accommodate up to 20+ passengers. This 18-seater tempo traveller in Agra gives you a comfortable journey.</p><h2><strong>How to Book Tempo Traveller on Rent in Agra with Duracabs</strong></h2><p>Booking a Tempo Traveller with Duracabs is designed to be simple, transparent, and user-friendly, whether you are tech-savvy or prefer direct assistance.</p><h3><strong>Step-by-Step Booking Process:</strong></h3><p><strong>Step 1. Visit Our Official Duracabs Website -</strong> choose Tempo Traveller rental page.</p><p><strong>Step 2. Browse the Available Tempo Traveller Options - </strong>Select from our wide range of vehicles including 9-seater, 15-seater, and 18-seater Tempo Travellers as per your group size and travel requirements.</p><p><strong>Step 3. Enter Trip Details - </strong>Fill in necessary trip information such as:</p><ul><li>Pickup location within Agra or surrounding areas</li><li>Travel destination(s)</li><li>Date and time of travel</li><li>Duration of your trip = pick-up and drop-off (single-day, multi-day, one-way or self-drive)</li></ul><p><strong>Step 4. Get an Instant Price Estimate - </strong>Our system provides you with a transparent and competitive price quote instantly, based on your inputs - including cash, credit/debit card, and online payment.</p><p><strong>Step 5. Confirm Your Booking - </strong>Review the details, confirm the booking by paying a minimal advance amount, and receive booking confirmation along with driver and vehicle details.</p><p><strong>Step 6. Enjoy Your Journey - </strong>Our professional driver arrives on time with a clean, ensuring your group enjoys a safe and comfortable journey.</p><h3><strong>Book Your Tempo Traveller in Agra with Duracabs Today!</strong></h3><p>For a smooth, reliable, and affordable group travel experience, hire a <strong>Tempo Traveller on Rent in Agra</strong> with Duracabs. Explore Agra and nearby destinations with comfort, safety, and convenience.</p><h2><strong>FAQs on Tempo Traveller Hire in Agra</strong></h2><h3><strong>Q1: Can I book a tempo traveller for outstation trips from Agra?</strong></h3><p>Ans. Yes, with Duracabs you can easily book a tempo traveller for outstation travel to destinations like Jaipur, Delhi, Mathura, and more. Our packages are flexible and competitively priced.</p><h3><strong>Q2: Do you provide tempo travellers for wedding functions or events?</strong></h3><p>Ans. Yes, we offer specialized tempo traveller rentals for weddings, corporate events, group functions, and family gatherings. Comfortable seating and punctual service make it hassle-free.</p><h3><strong>Q3: Is one-way tempo traveller service available from Agra?</strong></h3><p>Ans. Yes, Duracabs offers affordable one-way tempo traveller services from Agra to various cities, providing flexibility for your travel plans.</p><h3><strong>Q4: How can I book a tempo traveller with Duracabs?</strong></h3><p>Ans. Booking is simple. Visit our website or call us directly at <strong>+91-7088873331</strong>. You can also get an instant quote online and confirm your booking quickly.</p><h3><strong>Q5: Are air-conditioned tempo travellers available?</strong></h3><p>Ans. Yes, we offer both AC and Non-AC tempo travellers. AC options are ideal for summer trips or longer outstation journeys.</p><h3><strong>Q6: What is the seating capacity of the tempo travellers you offer?</strong></h3><p>Ans. We provide 9-seater, 15-seater, 18-seater, and Maharaja luxury tempo travellers to accommodate different group sizes.</p><h3><strong>Q7: Can I book a tempo traveller for Agra sightseeing?</strong></h3><p>Ans. Definitely! Our tempo travellers are perfect for local sightseeing tours, covering the Taj Mahal, Agra Fort, Mehtab Bagh, Fatehpur Sikri, and more.</p><h3><strong>Q8: How early should I book a tempo traveller, especially during peak season?</strong></h3><p>Ans. We recommend booking at least 24-48 hours in advance, especially during weekends, holidays, or festive seasons to ensure vehicle availability.</p><h3><strong>Q9: Do you provide tempo travellers for school or college trips?</strong></h3><p>Ans. Yes, we offer reliable and safe tempo traveller services for educational tours, school picnics, and college group trips.</p><h3><strong>Q10: How can I get the best rental rates for a tempo traveller?</strong></h3><p>Ans. Booking directly through our website or speaking to our customer service team ensures you receive the best rates and available discounts.</p><p><br><br></p><p><br></p>','page',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Book Tempo Traveller on Rent in Agra | 9 Seater to 18 Seater','Duracabs provides affordable & luxury Tempo Travellers on rent in Agra, available from 9-seater to 18-seater both for local sightseeing and outstation travel.','01JEWX0J8DHGE7E4EDB13VNECF.png','Tempo Traveller Hire in Agra.Tempo Traveller Hire in delhi,Tempo Traveller Hire in Agra,jaipur',NULL,NULL,NULL,'index,follow',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'WebPage',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Jaipur\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-in-jaipur\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Agra\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-agra\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Lucknow\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-in-lucknow\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In M