any time of the year. Then go for boat rides, fun and games along the river or for the most amazing view of the evening.</p><h3>Marble Rocks</h3><p>Maybe the great thing you\'ll see in Jabalpur is the peculiar Marble rocks along the Narmada River. Rising up to a height of 100ft, these mountains of marble appear in different forms and colors – including white, black, light blue, and light green – as you travel across the cable car or on a row boat. Soak in the beautiful views then, especially during the evening or on a full moon night, for a mystical experience that will be etched in your memory ever.</p><p><br></p>','page',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Car Rental In Jabalpur: Cabs in Jabalpur Rs.9/km only','Duracabs offerCar Rental In Jabalpur service 24x7. you book cabs in Jabalpur online for local and out stations trip from Jabalpur at very lowest prices.',NULL,'cab service in jabalpur,taxi service,taxi service in jabalpur,cab service,taxi service near me,car rental agencies in jabalpur,one way cab taxi,taxi cab online booking,car rental with driver,airport cab in jabalpur',NULL,NULL,NULL,'index,follow',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'WebPage',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Jaipur\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-in-jaipur\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Agra\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-agra\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Lucknow\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-in-lucknow\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Manali\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-in-manali\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Rishikesh\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-in-rishikesh\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Shimla\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-in-shimla\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Jabalpur\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-jabalpur\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In J