ki-Haveli</h3><p>Nathmal Ki Haveli was built by two Muslim jeweller brothers in the 19th century. It is said that two brothers Lulu and Hathi separately built the left and right wings of this architectural marvel , and is famous for its stunning yellow sandstone work. The interior of the Haveli is accentuated with beautiful paintings made using 1.5 kg of gold leaf and mighty tuskers carved out of yellow sandstone are used for decoration.</p><p><br></p>','page',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Car Rental In Jaisalmer: Cabs in Jaisalmer Rs.9/km only','Duracabs offerCar Rental In Jaisalmer service 24x7. you book cabs in Jaisalmer online for local and out stations trip from Jaisalmer at very lowest prices.',NULL,'cab service in jaisalmer,taxi service,taxi service in jaisalmer,cab service,taxi service near me,car rental agencies in jaisalmer,one way cab taxi,taxi cab online booking,car rental with driver,airport cab in jaisalmer',NULL,NULL,NULL,'index,follow',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'WebPage',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Jaipur\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-in-jaipur\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Agra\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-agra\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Lucknow\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-in-lucknow\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Manali\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-in-manali\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Rishikesh\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-in-rishikesh\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Shimla\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-in-shimla\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Jabalpur\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-jabalpur\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Jaisalmer\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-jaisalmer\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Jalandhar\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.