ar</h3><p>Jalandhar is a megacity located in the north Indian state of Punjab. Jalandhar was ruled by the Hindus and the Mughals in race and is believed to be the oldest megacity in Punjab. Jalandhar megacity was appertained to as Prasthala and as Jullundur at the time of the British Raj and is known for its rich artistic heritage, literal monuments, and traditional values.</p><h3>Imam Nasir Masjid</h3><p>The 800-time-old mausoleum houses a holy dargah and is believed to have been visited by Sufi saint Baba Farid. The 400-year-old Jama Masjid near Imam Nasir Masjid is also worth a visit. Both these mosques are very fine examples of the medieval period and are must-visit places to visit.</p><h3>Devi Talab Mandir</h3><p>The famous Devi Talab Temple is located just 1 km from the railway station in the heart of the Jalandhar megacity, and is believed to be over 200 years old. The Devi Temple, dedicated to Maa Durga, is one of the best structures to visit in Jalandhar and devotees from all over India come to offer prayers here. The Devi Talab Temple has been recently renovated and several changes have been made to the old structure.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p>','page',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Car Rental In Jalandhar: Cabs in Jalandhar Rs.9/km only','Duracabs offerCar Rental In Jalandhar service 24x7. you book cabs in Jalandhar online for local and out stations trip from Jalandhar at very lowest prices.',NULL,'cab service in jalandhar,taxi service,taxi service in jalandhar,cab service,taxi service near me,car rental agencies in jalandhar,one way cab taxi,taxi cab online booking,car rental with driver,airport cab in jalandhar',NULL,NULL,NULL,'index,follow',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'WebPage',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[{\"name\":\"Gurugram,Haryana To Jaipur,Rajasthan\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/route\\/gurugram-haryana-to-jaipur-rajasthan\"},{\"name\":\"Agra,Uttar Pradesh To Patiala,Punjab\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.c