and profitable center located in the Majha region of Punjab. The megacity is the executive headquarters of the Amritsar quarter. It\'s located along the India- Pakistan border, 217 km northwest of Chandigarh, 455 km northwest of New Delhi, and 47 km northeast of Lahore 28 km down.</p><h3>The Golden Temple</h3><p>The Golden Temple( also known as the Harmandir Sahib), the Darbār Sahib,\' exalted court\', is a gurdwara located in the megacity of Amritsar, Punjab, India. It\'s the preeminent spiritual point of Sikhism. It\'s one of the holiest spots in Sikhism, alongside the Gurdwara Darbar Sahib Kartarpur in Kartarpur, and Gurdwara Janam Asthan in Nankana Sahib.</p><h3>Wagah Border Ceremony</h3><p>A 31-kilometer drive west from the megacity center of Amritsar will take you to the border with Pakistan, where border-closing demonstrations take place every evening in the evening. Full of pomp and circumstance, the Beating Retreat ceremony involves a showy display of goose-stepping guards from the Indian Border Security Force and Pakistan Rangers, who salute each other, lower and lower their flags, and cross the border. Let\'s close the gates.</p><h3>Partition Museum</h3><p>The time 1947 was unforgettable for India. Not only was it the time that India gained its independence from Great Britain, but it was also the time it resolve into the two different realities of India and Pakistan an event known as the Partition of India.</p><p><br></p>','page',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Car Rental In Amritsar: Cabs in Amritsar Rs.9km only','Duracabs offerCar Rental In Amritsar service 24x7. you book cabs in Amritsar online for local and out stations trip from Amritsar at very lowest prices.',NULL,'cab service in amritsar,taxi service,taxi service in amritsar,cab service,taxi service near me,car rental agencies in amritsar,one way cab taxi,taxi cab online booking,car rental with driver,airport cab in amritsar',NULL,NULL,NULL,'index,follow',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'WebPage',NULL