ritz, swift dezire, ciaz as well chauffeur drive.</p><h3>Bahraich</h3><p>Bahraich District is one of the sections of Uttar Pradesh state of India, and Bahraich City is the quarter headquarters. Bahraich District is a part of Devipatan Division. Bahraich is in major Awadh. It borders Nepal sections Bardiya to the northwest and Banke to the northeast. The rest of Bahraich is girdled by other sections in Uttar Pradesh Lakhimpur and Sitapur on the west, Hardoi to the southwest, Gonda to the southeast, and Shravasti to the east.</p><h3>Mari Mata Mandir</h3><p>Mari Mata’s temple, located on the banks of the Saryu sluice along the Bahraich- Lucknow Highway at the northern end of Bahraich city in Uttar Pradesh, is a place of passage for people. During Navaratri, people from both pastoral and communal areas gather in temples to worship and pray. likewise, on Mondays and Fridays, a large cult gathers at the temple to worship. It is thought that whatever the devotee is doing in his mother’s court, his purpose is to grant his request.</p><h3>Dargah Shareef</h3><p>The Dargah of Syed Salar Masoud Ghazi, located in Uttar Pradesh’s Bahraich area, is largely spectacular. In Jeth, there\'s a large fair. In which people travel long distances. Do you know that Kadam Rasul Bhawan is located in the Dargah complex, which is an unexampled illustration of Tughlaq period architectural art? Jairin Kadam, who\'s on his way to the Dargah, walks ahead in Mahfouz Hazrat Mohammad’s footsteps in the Rasul Bhavan. The structure was built in 750 years. There are marks on the stone and the footmark of Prophet Hazrat Mohammad Sahib in this edifice.</p><h3>Sangharan Mandir</h3><p>This temple is from Maha Kali ji, and practically all of the goddess’s rupats are seated in it. Devotees come here to visit the mother during the two Chaitra and Ashwin Navaratris of the year.</p><p><br></p>','page',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Car Rental In Bahraich: Cabs in Bahraich Rs.9km only','Duracabs offerCar Rental In Bahr