r ever for all Needs of Travel Services in india. We are offer you Car rental in Bareilly, Car hire service in Bareilly, car on rent/hire in Bareilly, taxi service Bareilly, taxi for outstaion in Bareilly, wedding car rental in Bareilly, india tour package etc. Our cab such as Toyota Etios, innova, Crysta, wagonr, maruti ritz, swift dezire, ciaz as well chauffeur drive.</p><h3>Bareilly</h3><p>Bareilly is a megacity in Bareilly district in the Indian state of Uttar Pradesh. It\'s among the largest metropolises in Western Uttar Pradesh and is the center of the Bareilly division as well as the historical region of Rohilkhand. The megacity lies in the Indo- Gangetic Plains, about 252 kilometers northwest of the state capital, Lucknow, and 265 kilometers east of the public capital, New Delhi. With a population of 898,167 in 2011, it\'s the eighth most populous megacity in the state, seventeenth in northern India, and fifty-fourth in India. It\'s located on the bank of the Ramganga River and is the site of the Ramganga Barrage built for canal irrigation.</p><h3>Jagannath Temple</h3><p>Not to confuse with the Jagannath Temple of Odisha, this temple is located in the heart of Bareilly and it\'s devoted to Lord Shiva. two located in Orissa is devoted to Lord Vishnu. still, both are inversely beautiful and magnific. This ancient architecture is known for its beautiful paintings and sculptures that are almost 200 years old.</p><h3>Alaknath Temple</h3><p>This is one of the most notorious temples and best places to visit in Bareilly and it\'s devoted to Lord Shiva. This place also houses numerous Naga Sadhus and along with the statue of Lord Shiva, this temple also has numerous structures of Lord Hanuman.</p><h3>Dargah-E-Aalahazrat</h3><p>This is a splendid tomb that was built to honour Ahmed Raza Khan who was an Islamic scholar of the 19th century. He was also a jurist, Sufi, philosopher, and Urdu poet. Ahmed Raza Khan is famous as a Sunni revivalist and reformist leader at the time of the British era.</p><p><br></p>','page',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Car Rental In Bareilly: Cabs in Bareilly Rs.9km only','Duracabs offerCar Rental In Bareilly service 24x7. you book cabs in Bareilly online for local and out stations trip from Bareilly at very lowest prices.',NULL,'cab service in bareilly,taxi service,taxi service in bareilly,cab service,taxi service near me,car rental agencies in bareilly,one way cab taxi,taxi cab online booking,car rental with driver,airport cab in bareilly',NULL,NULL,NULL,'index,follow',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'WebPage',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Jaipur\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-in-jaipur\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Agra\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-agra\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Lucknow\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-in-lucknow\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Manali\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-in-manali\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Rishikesh\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-in-rishikesh\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Shimla\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-in-shimla\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Jabalpur\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-jabalpur\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Jaisalmer\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-jaisalmer\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Jalandhar\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-jalandhar\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Jhansi\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-jhansi\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Jhunjhunu\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-jhunjhunu\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Jodhpur\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-jodhpur\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Ambala\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.dura