lhi (OneWay Taxi) SUV\",\"oneway\":\"3800\",\"perKM\":\"14\"}]'),(21,'2005-11-24 05:45:00','2024-11-07 06:13:32','Car Rental In Bathinda',14,'car-rental-in-bathinda','<h1>Duracabs Car Rental in Bathinda</h1><p>Dura Cabs Services Provides You a best car hire &amp; rental service in Bathinda with Memorable moments and hassle-free journey. U are makes a relationship for ever for all Needs of Travel Services in india. We are offer you Car rental in Bathinda, Car hire service in Bathinda, car on rent/hire in Bathinda, taxi service Bathinda, taxi for outstaion in Bathinda, wedding car rental in Bathinda, india tour package etc. Our cab such as Toyota Etios, innova, Crysta, wagonr, maruti ritz, swift dezire, ciaz as well chauffeur drive.</p><h3>Bathinda</h3><p>Bathinda is a megacity in Punjab, whose old name was Bathinda. This name was named after lords from the Bhati Rajput family who ruled the area. It\'s also the administrative head office for the Bathinda district. The megacity is located just 225 kilometers down in the west of Punjab’s capital megacity of Chandigarh. Bathinda is also known as the City of Lakes. In the olden days, the megacity was known as the Tabarhindh or Tabar-e-hind, the meaning of which is Gateway to India.</p><h3>Rose Garden</h3><p>This lush green garden of 10 acres is an ideal place to watch the natural beauty. You can then go for a short excursion or enjoy all the fun and games at this place. Children also love this Rose Garden in Bathinda as it offers some adventurous rides. You must visit the garden during winter if you like to be surrounded by natural roses. The knowledge of natural flowers blossoming amidst the mesmerizing air of this place is surely a sight to behold. While you are in Rose Garden, don’t miss out on the delicious delicacies around to fulfill your tummies.</p><h3>Qila Mubarak</h3><p>This stronghold was before known as Tabar-e-Hind or the gateway to India. Qila Mubarak Gurudwara Sahib is a veritably important literal point in