arh Fort</h3><p>Lohagarh Fort, or Iron Fort, is one of the strongest structures in Rajasthan, and a must-visit attraction in Bharatpur. It\'s its unassailable defense quality that gave it its important name when it was built in the early 18th century by Jat sovereign Maharaja Suraj Mal. The fort is austere and imposing, and its air of unperturbed strength is what attracts hundreds of tourists to its grounds yearly.</p><p><br></p>','page',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Car Rental In Bharatpur: Cabs in Bharatpur Rs.9km only','Duracabs offerCar Rental In Bharatpur service 24x7. you book cabs in Bharatpur online for local and out stations trip from Bharatpur at very lowest prices.',NULL,'cab service in bharatpur,taxi service,taxi service in bharatpur,cab service,taxi service near me,car rental agencies in bharatpur,one way cab taxi,taxi cab online booking,car rental with driver,airport cab in bharatpur',NULL,NULL,NULL,'index,follow',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'WebPage',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Jaipur\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-in-jaipur\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Agra\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-agra\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Lucknow\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-in-lucknow\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Manali\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-in-manali\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Rishikesh\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-in-rishikesh\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Shimla\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-in-shimla\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Jabalpur\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-jabalpur\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Jaisalmer\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-jaisalmer\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Jalandhar\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental