adquarters of the Udaipur quarter. It\'s the major capital of the area of Mewar in the former Rajputana Agency. It was innovated in 1559 by Udai Singh II of the Sisodia clan of Rajputs when he shifted his capital from the megacity of Chittorgarh to Udaipur after Chittorgarh was besieged by Akbar. It remained the capital megacity till 1818 when it came to a British kingly state, and there after the Mewar fiefdom came a part of Rajasthan when India gained independence in 1947.</p><h3>Lake Palace</h3><p>Famous as one of the most royale and romantic hotels in the world, Lake Palace was formerly known as Jag Niwas and is one of the top Udaipur lodestones. It\'s one of the most beautiful places to visit in Udaipur at night. The Taj Group took over the palace and has painstakingly restored and maintained the heritage of these most sought-after resorts.</p><h3>Fateh Sagar Lake</h3><p>It\'s one of the most beautiful places to visit in Udaipur, Rajasthan. Fateh Sagar Lake is one of the most beautiful lakes in Rajasthan. It consists of three islands and each one has well-maintained public gardens that can be reached by a boat ride it\'s a good place to spend time in the evening.</p><p><br></p>','page',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Car Rental In Udaipur: Cabs in Udaipur Rs.9/km only','Duracabs offerCar Rental In Udaipur service 24x7. you book cabs in Udaipur online for local and out stations trip from Udaipur at very lowest prices.',NULL,'cab service in udaipur,taxi service,taxi service in udaipur,cab service,taxi service near me,car rental agencies in udaipur,one way cab taxi,taxi cab online booking,car rental with driver,airport cab in udaipur',NULL,NULL,NULL,'index,follow',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'WebPage',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Jaipur\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-in-jaipur\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Agra\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-agra\"},{\"nam