al of a big empire.</p><h3>Mahakaleshwar Jyotirlinga</h3><p>Mahakaleshwar Temple, located in the ancient metropolis of Ujjain in the state of Madhya Pradesh, is one of the 12 Jyotirlingas in India. This temple is situated near the Rudra Sagar Lake and is dedicated to Lord Shiva.</p><h3>Kal Bhairav Temple</h3><p>The temple is believed to be associated with a tantric cult in Hinduism, so you will see many sadhus who then come to practice their tantric meditation. There is a Shivalinga under a banyan tree in front of Nandi the bull. The bull here had to be present with King Daksha. That\'s why this temple has great importance for the Hindus.</p><p><br></p>','page',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Car Rental In Ujjain: Cabs in Ujjain Rs.9/km only','Duracabs offerCar Rental In Ujjain service 24x7. you book cabs in Ujjain online for local and out stations trip from Ujjain at very lowest prices.',NULL,'cab service in ujjain,taxi service,taxi service in ujjain,cab service,taxi service near me,car rental agencies in ujjain,one way cab taxi,taxi cab online booking,car rental with driver,airport cab in ujjain',NULL,NULL,NULL,'index,follow',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'WebPage',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Jaipur\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-in-jaipur\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Agra\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-agra\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Lucknow\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-in-lucknow\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Manali\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-in-manali\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Rishikesh\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-in-rishikesh\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Shimla\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-in-shimla\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Jabalpur\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-jabalpur\"},{\"nam