tz, swift dezire, ciaz as well chauffeur drive.</p><h3>Faridabad</h3><p>The megacity of Faridabad was founded in the time 1607 by Shaikh Farid, also known as Baba Farid. He was a famous Sufi saint and was also the treasurer of the Mughal emperor, Jahangir. The city was established in order to protect the grand trunk Road. It was later announced as the headquarters of Faridabad Pargana, which was under the rule of Ballabgarh. Tewatia Jat Sardar Gopal Singh attacked the city, after the death of Aurangzeb.</p><h3>Surajkund Lake</h3><p>One of the most popular places to visit in Faridabad is the 10th-century reservoir Surajkund, which means Lake of the Sun. The lake was built by the Tomar dynasty autonomous Suraj Pal, who was a devotee of Lord Sun and hence constructed a Sun temple( in remains now) on its western bank apart from a garden and a pool.</p><h3>ISKCON Temple</h3><p>The International Society for Krishna Consciousness (ISKCON), also known as Sri Radha Govind Temple, is dedicated to Hindu God Krishna and Goddess Radha. Other presiding deities of this temple are God Ram, Goddess Sita, God Laxman, and God Hanuman.</p><p><br></p>','page',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Car Rental In Faridabad: Cabs in Faridabad Rs.9km only','Duracabs offerCar Rental In Faridabad service 24x7. you book cabs in Faridabad online for local and out stations trip from Faridabad at very lowest prices.',NULL,'car rental delhi airport,car rental in delhi airport,delhi airport Car Rental,car rent delhi airport,car booking delhi airport,cab service in delhi airport,taxi service,taxi service in delhi airport,cab taxi service,cab taxi service near me,car rental agencies delhi airport,one way cab taxi,taxi cab online booking,car rental with driver,airport cab',NULL,NULL,NULL,'index,follow',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'WebPage',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Jaipur\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-in-jaipur\"},{\"name\":\