strict. It\'s one of the biggest cotton markets in South- East Asia.</p><h3>Qilla Mubarak</h3><p>The fort with its impressive architecture still adorns the city of Faridkot. Its foundation is believed to have been laid by Raja Mokalsi, Raka Hamir Singh renovated it and got it extended. Later rulers like Raja Bikram Singh. Raja Balbir Singh got constructed many new buildings. It housed the Royal Place. Tosha Khana, Modi Khana &amp; Treasury Buildings. There is a garden within the four walls of the fort. All the buildings are very well built and well furnished.</p><h3>Raj Mahal</h3><p>‘ Raj Mahal ’( royal Palace) was erected during the reign of Maharaja Bikrama Singh during 1885- 1889 under supervision of the, also Crown Prince( later Maharaja) Balbir Singh, who incidentally was the first to move by and start living in it.</p><p><br></p>','page',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Car Rental In Faridkot: Cabs in Faridkot Rs.9km only','Duracabs offerCar Rental In Faridkot service 24x7. you book cabs in Faridkot online for local and out stations trip from Faridkot at very lowest prices.',NULL,'car rental delhi airport,car rental in delhi airport,delhi airport Car Rental,car rent delhi airport,car booking delhi airport,cab service in delhi airport,taxi service,taxi service in delhi airport,cab taxi service,cab taxi service near me,car rental agencies delhi airport,one way cab taxi,taxi cab online booking,car rental with driver,airport cab',NULL,NULL,NULL,'index,follow',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'WebPage',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Jaipur\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-in-jaipur\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Agra\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-agra\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Lucknow\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-in-lucknow\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Manali\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-in-manali\"