hsil of Farrukhabad quarter Uttar Pradesh, swargdwari was the capital of gharwars. The last king of this megacity was Kunwar Rai Singh, he\'s also known as Khorah in major literature of 12th and 13th-century announcements.</p><h3>Sandi bird sanctuary</h3><p>Sandi birds sanctuary is situated in Hardoi district Uttar Pradesh, this sanctuary covers 308 hectares, and this sanctuary is 129 km down from Lucknow and from Hardoi 20 km. This sanctuary is also called deher jheel.</p><p><br></p>','page',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Car Rental In Farrukhabad: Cabs in Farrukhabad Rs.9km only','Duracabs offerCar Rental In Farrukhabad service 24x7. for local and out stations trip from Farrukhabad at very lowest prices.',NULL,'car rental delhi airport,car rental in delhi airport,delhi airport Car Rental,car rent delhi airport,car booking delhi airport,cab service in delhi airport,taxi service,taxi service in delhi airport,cab taxi service,cab taxi service near me,car rental agencies delhi airport,one way cab taxi,taxi cab online booking,car rental with driver,airport cab',NULL,NULL,NULL,'index,follow',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'WebPage',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Jaipur\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-in-jaipur\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Agra\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-agra\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Lucknow\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-in-lucknow\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Manali\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-in-manali\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Rishikesh\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-in-rishikesh\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Shimla\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-in-shimla\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Jabalpur\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-jabalpur\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Jaisalmer\",\"url\":