 later a mosque was also erected then as a tribute to him.</p><p><br></p>','page',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Car Rental In Fatehabad: Cabs in Fatehabad Rs.9km only','Duracabs offerCar Rental In Fatehabad service 24x7. you book cabs in Fatehabad online for local and out stations trip from Fatehabad at very lowest prices.',NULL,'car rental delhi airport,car rental in delhi airport,delhi airport Car Rental,car rent delhi airport,car booking delhi airport,cab service in delhi airport,taxi service,taxi service in delhi airport,cab taxi service,cab taxi service near me,car rental agencies delhi airport,one way cab taxi,taxi cab online booking,car rental with driver,airport cab',NULL,NULL,NULL,'index,follow',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'WebPage',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Jaipur\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-in-jaipur\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Agra\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-agra\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Lucknow\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-in-lucknow\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Manali\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-in-manali\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Rishikesh\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-in-rishikesh\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Shimla\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-in-shimla\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Jabalpur\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-jabalpur\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Jaisalmer\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-jaisalmer\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Jalandhar\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-jalandhar\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Jhansi\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-jhansi\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Jhunjhunu\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-jhunjhunu\"