ysta, wagonr, maruti ritz, swift dezire, ciaz as well chauffeur drive.</p><h3>Gwalior</h3><p>Gwalior district is a district of the Indian state of Madhya Pradesh. This district is under the profit division of Gwalior. This district is positioned between 25 0 43 ‘ north and 26 0 21 ′ north latitude and 77 0 40 ‘ east and 78 0 39 ’ in the northern part of Gwalior state.</p><h3>Gwalior Fort</h3><p>Gwalior Fort has been a witness to many battles and incidents. Standing tall atop a rocky mountain, this architectural phenomenon is spread over an area of 3 sq km and is visible from all corners of the megacity. There are many stone structures inside the citadel, including palaces, temples, and water tanks, and it can take about a day to visit the place.</p><h3>Teli Ka Mandir</h3><p>An ancient religious point famous for its Dravidian armature and detailed artwork, Teli Ka Mandir is the tallest structure inside the Gwalior Fort complex. It\'s around 100ft tall and the architecture is a mix of Buddhist and Hindu styles. According to chroniclers, this temple was constructed during the 8th or 11th century and is the oldest temple in the stronghold. It\'s devoted to Lord Vishnu in the form of his mount ‘ Garuda ’ and also has structures of curled serpents and swash goddesses outside.</p><p><br></p>','page',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Car Rental In Gwalior: Cabs in Gwalior Rs.9km only','Duracabs offerCar Rental In Gwalior service 24x7. you book cabs in Gwalior online for local and out stations trip from Gwalior at very lowest prices.',NULL,'cab service in gwalior,taxi service,taxi service in gwalior,cab taxi service,cab taxi service near me,car rental agencies gwalior,one way cab taxi,taxi cab online booking,car rental with driver,airport cab',NULL,NULL,NULL,'index,follow',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'WebPage',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Jaipur\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-in-jaipur\"},{\"name\"