website to go from Agra to Hathras.</p><h3>Hathras Fort</h3><p>Hathras megacity has various spots those are must- visit for curious trippers. The Hathras Fort is the most visited place which represents the megacity’s noble history. The stronghold was erected during the reign of Raja Dayaram Singh in around the 18th century.</p><h3>Baghraya Temple</h3><p>This is famous temples in this city where Baba Jaharveer is worshipped. It also salutes the 51 freedom fighter from the Hathras who fought for India’s independence. Some other popular temples in Hathras City are Shivji Mandi, Navagrah Mandi, Hanuman Mandir etc.</p><p><br></p>','page',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Car Rental In Hathras: Cabs in Hathras Rs.9/km only','Duracabs offerCar Rental In Hathras service 24x7. you book cabs in Hathras online for local and out stations trip from Hathras at very lowest prices.',NULL,'car rental delhi airport,car rental in delhi airport,delhi airport Car Rental,car rent delhi airport,car booking delhi airport,cab service in delhi airport,taxi service,taxi service in delhi airport,cab taxi service,cab taxi service near me,car rental agencies delhi airport,one way cab taxi,taxi cab online booking,car rental with driver,airport cab',NULL,NULL,NULL,'index,follow',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'WebPage',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Jaipur\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-in-jaipur\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Agra\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-agra\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Lucknow\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-in-lucknow\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Manali\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-in-manali\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Rishikesh\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-in-rishikesh\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Shimla\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-in-shiml