ial Ana Sagar Lake is Ajmer Sharif Dargah, the domed shrine of the Muslim Sufi saint Garib Nawaz. Nearby, a 16th-century palace built by the Mughal emperor Akbar now houses the Ajmer Government Museum, displaying armor and stone sculptures. A museum at the Indo-Saracenic–style Mayo College exhibits art and taxidermied birds.</p><h3>Dargah Khwaja Sahib</h3><p>the landmark of Ajmer, revered by all the sects, one of the holiest Muslim shrines in the country. Millions of pilgrims within the country and abroad, come here to pay homage at the shrine. Dargah is the final resting place of the great Sufi saint - Khwaja Moinuddin Chishti - tab bestower of boons. The tomb is richly adorned with gold and silver.</p><h3>Adhai Din Ka Jhonpra</h3><p>is a relic of an old mosque you consisting of quadrangle to pp stered on all the four side, front screen wall of 7 pointed arches. It is believed that Muhammad ghori ordered, that the mosque you be made ready for his prayer within two and half days.</p><h3>Ana Sagar</h3><p>Ana Sagar Lake is an artificial lake deposited in the megacity of Ajmer in Rajasthan state in India. It was erected by Arnoraja, the father of Prithviraj Chauhan, in 1135- 1150 announcement and is named after him. The catchments were erected with the help of original crowd. The lake is spread over 13 km(8.1 mi).</p><h3>Taragarh fort</h3><p>Taragarh Fort is a stronghold erected upon a steep hillside in the municipality of Ajmer in the Indian state of Rajasthan. It was constructed in the 8th century by Ajayaraja Chauhan( 721 – 734) and it was originally called Ajaymeru Durg..</p><h3>Abdullah Khan\'s tomb</h3><p>Abdulla Khan\'s Tomb is a beautiful bio made up of white marble, erected by the Sayyaid sisters in 1710 bulletin for their father. The blockish grave, located on a raised platform with four way, has been designed with ornamented bends and four halls. The grave is an excellent epitome of the designs of the after Mughal period. A shrine then mentions a synagogue being present close to it; still, the only structure located hard is the grave of Abdulla Khan\'s woman.</p><h3>Anted ki Mata</h3><p>the temple has beautiful surroundings. It is a sight of a fair held every year on rakshabandhan. Close to Anted ki Mata, stands group of chhatris and chabutras (Thadas), belonging to the digambar Jains of Ajmer. Some other places of interest in and around the city are dadabari, Khobra Bharron, Magazine, Nasian (Red Temple), Rajputana museum etc</p><p><br></p>','page',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Car Rental In Ajmer: Cabs In Ajmer Rs.9km only','Duracabs offerCar Rental In Ajmer service 24x7. you book cabs in Ajmer online for local and out stations trip from Ajmer at very lowest prices.',NULL,'car rental delhi airport,car rental in delhi airport,delhi airport Car Rental,car rent delhi airport,car booking delhi airport,cab service in delhi airport,taxi service,taxi service in delhi airport,cab taxi service,cab taxi service near me,car rental agencies delhi airport,one way cab taxi,taxi cab online booking,car rental with driver,airport cab',NULL,NULL,NULL,'index,follow',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'WebPage',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Jaipur\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-in-jaipur\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Agra\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-agra\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Lucknow\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-in-lucknow\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Manali\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-in-manali\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Rishikesh\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-in-rishikesh\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Shimla\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-in-shimla\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Jabalpur\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-jabalpur\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Jaisalmer\