.</p><h3>Aligarh fort</h3><p>Aligarh Fort, also known as Aligarh Quila. Popularly called as\" Bonay Chor ka Kila\", it represents major Islamic influences through its exquisite architecture and intricate representational busts, though ultimate of it\'s in remains now.</p><h3>Sir Syed House Museum</h3><p>Sir Syed House Museum, located in the Aligarh Muslim University, is a well- known art gallery amongst the locals. Formerly the gallery was Sir Syed’s home, the author of Mohammedan Anglo- Oriental College( which was converted into Aligarh Muslim University in 1920).</p><h3>Khereshwar Temple</h3><p>Located in Aligarh, the Khereshwar Temple is devoted to Lord Shiva and is known for the holy Shiva linga, which is so small that it\'s popularly known as inconspicuous Shiva linga. Other highlights of the temple include metallic aquarelle engraved ceiling and brass icons of other Hindu deities.</p><p><br></p>','page',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Car Rental In Aligarh: Cabs in Aligarh Rs.9km only','Duracabs offerCar Rental In Aligarh service 24x7. you book cabs in Aligarh online for local and out stations trip from Aligarh at very lowest prices.',NULL,'car rental delhi airport,car rental in delhi airport,delhi airport Car Rental,car rent delhi airport,car booking delhi airport,cab service in delhi airport,taxi service,taxi service in delhi airport,cab taxi service,cab taxi service near me,car rental agencies delhi airport,one way cab taxi,taxi cab online booking,car rental with driver,airport cab',NULL,NULL,NULL,'index,follow',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'WebPage',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Jaipur\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-in-jaipur\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Agra\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-agra\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Lucknow\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-in-lucknow\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Manali\",\"url\":\