gion at an altitude of 553 m above ocean position, on the banks of two small river– the Saraswati and the Khan. They unite at the centre of the city where a small 18th- century temple of Sangamnath or Indreshwar exists. The name Indore is due to this diety. It\'s the largest city in Madhya Pradesh state in central India. It\'s among the million+ population cities of India with a population of 32,76,697.</p><h3>Rajwada Palace</h3><p>The magnific Rajwada Palace was erected by the autocrats of the Holkar Dynasty about two centuries agone. It\'s a seven-storied structure that exemplifies grandeur and architectural craftsmanship. Replete with landscaped gardens and fountains, this palace presents a sight to behold. erected in the Maratha, French, and Mughal architectural styles, this grand palace exhibits ornamented jharokas, lofty archways, elaborate wooden jalis, and splendid chattries. It\'s surely one of the best places to visit in Indore.</p><h3>Lal Bagh Palace</h3><p>Lal Bagh Palace, which was formerly the residence of the Holkar rulers of Indore, exemplifies substance and majesty. presently, the palace serves as a gallery that displays a range of intriguing vestiges.</p><p><br></p>','page',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Car Rental In Indore: Cabs in Indore Rs.9/km only','Duracabs offerCar Rental In Indore service 24x7. you book cabs in Indore online for local and out stations trip from Indore at very lowest prices.',NULL,'car rental delhi airport,car rental in delhi airport,delhi airport Car Rental,car rent delhi airport,car booking delhi airport,cab service in delhi airport,taxi service,taxi service in delhi airport,cab taxi service,cab taxi service near me,car rental agencies delhi airport,one way cab taxi,taxi cab online booking,car rental with driver,airport cab',NULL,NULL,NULL,'index,follow',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'WebPage',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Jaipur\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pag