>Karauli District is a quarter of Rajasthan in western India. It\'s located in the Braj region. The city of Karauli is the quarter headquarters. Karauli District comes under Bharatpur Divisional Commissionerate. Karauli is notorious for its popular red gravestone. The population of the quarter is( 2011 tale), indicating a population viscosity is 264 persons per km2. The distance between Agra to Karauli by Road is, 160 Kms.</p><h3>Kaila Devi Temple</h3><p>Kaila Devi temple is a Hindu religious temple, known to be one of the 9 Shakti paths of goddess Durga. Located on the banks of Kalisil River at a distance of 23 km from Karauli megacity. It\'s believed that the temple was erected in 1100 AD. The Kaila Devi Temple hosts an annual fair that lasts a fortnight and attracts millions of pilgrims every year</p><h3>Bhanwar Vilas Palace</h3><p>Bhanwar Vilas Palace is a historical monument that was constructed by Maharaja Ganesh Pal Dev Bhadur in 1938. The interior of the palace is decorated with regal-style furniture and the design of the palace reflects the hard work of the ancient engineers. Bhanwar Vilas Palace has now been renovated into a high-class hotel.</p><p><br></p>','page',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Car Rental In Karauli: Cabs in Karauli Rs.9/km only','Duracabs offerCar Rental In Karauli service 24x7. you book cabs in Karauli online for local and out stations trip from Karauli at very lowest prices.',NULL,'car rental delhi airport,car rental in delhi airport,delhi airport Car Rental,car rent delhi airport,car booking delhi airport,cab service in delhi airport,taxi service,taxi service in delhi airport,cab taxi service,cab taxi service near me,car rental agencies delhi airport,one way cab taxi,taxi cab online booking,car rental with driver,airport cab',NULL,NULL,NULL,'index,follow',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'WebPage',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Jaipur\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-ren