adium in the city of Ludhiana, Punjab. Many big events of football and athletics take place in this stadium. The capacity of the stadium to hold at least 15,000 spectators. The Kabaddi World Cup was held at this stadium and was attended by many famous celebrities like Katrina Kaif.</p><h3>Gurudwara Mehdiana Sahib</h3><p>Gurudwara Mehdiana Sahib is famously known as the \'School of Sikh\'. This is one of the most important places to visit in Ludhiana City and Shri Guru Gobind Singh Ji visited the site of Gurdwara Shri Mehdiana Sahib after the Battle of Chamkaur.</p><p><br></p>','page',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Car Rental In Ludhiana: Cabs in Ludhiana Rs.9/km only','Duracabs offerCar Rental In Ludhiana service 24x7. you book cabs in Ludhiana online for local and out stations trip from Ludhiana at very lowest prices.',NULL,'car rental delhi airport,car rental in delhi airport,delhi airport Car Rental,car rent delhi airport,car booking delhi airport,cab service in delhi airport,taxi service,taxi service in delhi airport,cab taxi service,cab taxi service near me,car rental agencies delhi airport,one way cab taxi,taxi cab online booking,car rental with driver,airport cab',NULL,NULL,NULL,'index,follow',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'WebPage',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Jaipur\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-in-jaipur\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Agra\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-agra\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Lucknow\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-in-lucknow\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Manali\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-in-manali\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Rishikesh\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-in-rishikesh\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Shimla\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-in-shimla\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Jabalpur\",\"u