 to the nation on 24 December 2015 by former Defence Minister Manohar Parrikkar. The bridge is positioned on Dunera to Basohli road and was erected to ameliorate connectivity among three countries of India- Punjab, Jammu and Kashmir, and Himachal Pradesh. The ground is named after former Prime Minister Atal Bihari Vajpayee, and devoted to the nation one day before his birthday.</p><h3>Ranjit Sagar Dam</h3><p>Ranjit Sagar Dam makes a nice place to enjoy a day out with friends or family as it has many tourist places near Pathankot where you can relax. Ranjit Sagar Dam is also known as Thien Dam and it was built on the Ravi river.</p><p><br></p>','page',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Car Rental In Pathankot: Cabs in Pathankot Rs.9/km only','Duracabs offerCar Rental In Pathankot service 24x7. you book cabs in Pathankot online for local and out stations trip from Pathankot at very lowest prices.',NULL,'car rental delhi airport,car rental in delhi airport,delhi airport Car Rental,car rent delhi airport,car booking delhi airport,cab service in delhi airport,taxi service,taxi service in delhi airport,cab taxi service,cab taxi service near me,car rental agencies delhi airport,one way cab taxi,taxi cab online booking,car rental with driver,airport cab',NULL,NULL,NULL,'index,follow',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'WebPage',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Jaipur\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-in-jaipur\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Agra\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-agra\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Lucknow\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-in-lucknow\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Manali\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-in-manali\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Rishikesh\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-in-rishikesh\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Shimla\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\