3><p>The district of Rudraprayag is located at the junction of River Alaknanda and Mandakini in the state of Uttaranchal. Rudraprayag is named after Rudra, an aspect of Lord Shiva.</p><h3>Chopta</h3><p>Chopta also known as a ‘ mini Switzerland of Uttarakhand’, this hill station is located in the lap of the Himalayas. It is located at an elevation of 2900 metres. It is one of the most popular tourists attraction in Rudraprayag.</p><h3>Joshimath</h3><p>Joshimath has located 114 km from Rudraprayag. It is a small town in Chamoli district in Uttarakhand, India. The beautiful town is surrounded by coniferous and oak forests and offers a spectacular view of the mountain peaks of Doonagiri, Nanda Devi, Hathi Parbat, Neelkanth, Bithartoli, and Kamet.</p><p><br></p>','page',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Car Rental In Rudraprayag: Cabs in Rudraprayag Rs.9/km only','Duracabs offerCar Rental In Rudraprayag service 24x7. you book cabs in Rudraprayag online for local and out stations trip from Rudraprayag at very low prices.',NULL,'car rental delhi airport,car rental in delhi airport,delhi airport Car Rental,car rent delhi airport,car booking delhi airport,cab service in delhi airport,taxi service,taxi service in delhi airport,cab taxi service,cab taxi service near me,car rental agencies delhi airport,one way cab taxi,taxi cab online booking,car rental with driver,airport cab',NULL,NULL,NULL,'index,follow',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'WebPage',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Jaipur\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-in-jaipur\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Agra\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-agra\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Lucknow\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-in-lucknow\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Manali\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-in-manali\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Rishikesh\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.d