fore Baba Bhua Dev even after returning from the temple of Shakumbhari Devi.</p><h3>Shakumbhari Devi Temple</h3><p>It is located in the area of Jasmour village, about 40 km north of Saharanpur in Uttar Pradesh, India. It has two major Hindu temples: one dedicated to the goddess Shakumbhari, and the other to the deity Bhairava, who is considered her patron. Near Sambhar Lake, in Rajasthan, there is another temple dedicated to Shakumbhari Devi which is quite famous. Badami, in the Bagalkot district of Karnataka, has another large temple dedicated to Shakumbhari Devi.</p><p><br></p>','page',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Car Rental In Saharanpur: Cabs in Saharanpur Rs.9/km only','Duracabs offerCar Rental In Saharanpur service 24x7. you book cabs in Saharanpur online for local and out stations trip from Saharanpur at very lowest prices.',NULL,'car rental delhi airport,car rental in delhi airport,delhi airport Car Rental,car rent delhi airport,car booking delhi airport,cab service in delhi airport,taxi service,taxi service in delhi airport,cab taxi service,cab taxi service near me,car rental agencies delhi airport,one way cab taxi,taxi cab online booking,car rental with driver,airport cab',NULL,NULL,NULL,'index,follow',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'WebPage',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Jaipur\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-in-jaipur\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Agra\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-agra\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Lucknow\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-in-lucknow\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Manali\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-in-manali\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Rishikesh\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-in-rishikesh\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Shimla\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-in-shimla\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In 