ring the British imperialism in India. During the time of the British Raj, Kala Aam was used as a public execution site and stands as a testament to the Indian rebellion against the British government in India. A very popular landmark for kala aam, is the district court of Bulandshahr.</p><h3>Hanuman Temple Bulandshahr</h3><p>The Hanuman Temple is devoted to Lord Hanuman. A 40- feet-high statue of God as the incarnation of a monkey has been built. Lord Hanuman is deeply reversed for his physical strength and austerity.</p><p><br></p>','page',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Car Rental In Bulandshahr: Cabs in Bulandshahr Rs.9km only','Duracabs offerCar Rental In Bulandshahr service 24x7. you book cabs in Bulandshahr online for local and out stations trip from Bulandshahr at low prices.',NULL,'car rental delhi airport,car rental in delhi airport,delhi airport Car Rental,car rent delhi airport,car booking delhi airport,cab service in delhi airport,taxi service,taxi service in delhi airport,cab taxi service,cab taxi service near me,car rental agencies delhi airport,one way cab taxi,taxi cab online booking,car rental with driver,airport cab',NULL,NULL,NULL,'index,follow',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'WebPage',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Jaipur\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-in-jaipur\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Agra\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-agra\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Lucknow\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-in-lucknow\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Manali\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-in-manali\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Rishikesh\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-in-rishikesh\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Shimla\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-in-shimla\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Jabalpur\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\