eresting place that not only holds religious significance but also historical significance, Aughadnath Temple is one of the important places to visit in Meerut and this temple is dedicated to Lord Shiva, this Hindu temple is located in the Cantonment area of the city and this temple is one of the most popular tourist attraction in Meerut.</p><h3>Hastinapur</h3><p>Hastinapur is an ancient town which was the center of the glorious tales of the epic Mahabharata. Situated on the banks of the Ganga near Meerut in UP, Hastinapur is also the birthplace of three Jain Teerthankara, and it has become an important center of pilgrimage for the Jains.</p><p><br></p>','page',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Car Rental In Meerut: Cabs in Meerut Rs.9/km only','Duracabs offerCar Rental In Meerut service 24x7. you book cabs in Meerut online for local and out stations trip from Meerut at very lowest prices.',NULL,'car rental delhi airport,car rental in delhi airport,delhi airport Car Rental,car rent delhi airport,car booking delhi airport,cab service in delhi airport,taxi service,taxi service in delhi airport,cab taxi service,cab taxi service near me,car rental agencies delhi airport,one way cab taxi,taxi cab online booking,car rental with driver,airport cab',NULL,NULL,NULL,'index,follow',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'WebPage',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Jaipur\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-in-jaipur\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Agra\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-agra\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Lucknow\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-in-lucknow\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Manali\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-in-manali\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Rishikesh\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-in-rishikesh\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Shimla\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pag