24-11-08 00:50:53','Car Rental Morena',86,'car-rental-morena','<h1>Duracabs Car Rental in Morena</h1><p>Dura Cabs Services Provides You a best car hire &amp; rental service in Morena with Memorable moments and hassle-free journey. U are makes a relationship for ever for all Needs of Travel Services in india. We are offer you Car rental in Morena, Car hire service in Morena, car on rent/hire in Morena, taxi service Morena, taxi for outstaion in Morena, wedding car rental in Morena, india tour package etc. Our cab such as Toyota Etios, innova, Crysta, wagonr, maruti ritz, swift dezire, ciaz as well chauffeur drive.</p><h3>Morena</h3><p>Morena is one of the 52 districts of Madhya Pradesh and it is also called Pech Morena. The name of the place is derived from \"Mor\" and \"Raina\" – meaning a place where peacocks are found in plenty and Morena is home to the largest number of peacocks in India.</p><h3>Sabalgarh Fort</h3><p>This fort of historical importance is located in the small town of Sabalgarh, about 70 km from the megacity of Morena. This fort is situated on a 100 feet high hill in the northeastern part of Sabalgarh. The citadel consists of a protective structure and a main palace and several other structures.</p><h3>Chausath Yogini Temple</h3><p>Chausath Yogini Temple is located in Mitauli township near Padaoli in Morena district, about 40 km from Gwalior. The temple was built by Kachchhapaghat king Devpal according to an inscription dated 1323 CE. It is said that the temple served as a platform for teaching astrology and mathematics based on the transit of the Sun and the Archaeological Survey of India declared the temple an ancient and historical monument.</p><p><br></p>','page',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Car Rental In Morena: Cabs in Morena Rs.9/km only','Duracabs offerCar Rental In Morena service 24x7. you book cabs in Morena online for local and out stations trip from Morena at very lowest prices.',NULL,'car rental delhi airport,car rental in delhi airport,d