2pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">&nbsp;Are you going to the wedding but don\'t want to go home at night?&nbsp; Book a one-way cab with Duracabs and enjoy the party while we take care of the driving.</span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">&nbsp;Or do you need to take someone you care about to the airport? Just go to one side.&nbsp; Duracabs\' quick and on-time one-way cab service will make your trip easy.</span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">&nbsp;You can party, celebrate, or travel without worrying about getting back with Duracabs\' trustworthy one-way cab service.</span></p>\n<h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.999999999999998pt; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; color: #434343; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Explore Incredible India, One Road Trip at a Time</span></h3>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">The world around you is full of hidden gems waiting to be explored. There is beauty everywhere, from the serene backwaters of Alleppey to the sun-kissed beaches of Alibag and the serene coastal lanes of Tranquebar to the historic charm of Khajuraho. We want you to see it all. So prepare your belongings, choose a location, and go out every weekend to learn something new.</span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">We at Duracabs make vacation planning easier. You can simply use our website duracabs.com to book a taxi or give us a call at 7088873331 to speak with one of our executives about your travel arrangements. We will assist you in creating the ideal itinerary, offer local travel advice, and ensure a hassle-free and seamless trip when you reserve an outstation taxi with us. You will be led by our skilled drivers through some of India\'s greatest attractions, cuisines, and undiscovered treasures. We ensure that every mile of your road trip becomes a memory from the time you reserve your ride until you get home.</span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">One of the most thrilling ways to see India\'s vastness is by road with Duracabs. There\'s always something fresh to learn and explore. We\'ve put a lot of effort into making sure you enjoy road travel as much as we do. Take a seat back and unwind in our chauffeur-driven taxis rather than driving yourself. We think you should have total control over your vacation time. In more than 2000 Indian cities today, Duracabs is available to transport you wherever you want to go.</span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">We love that when you travel by road, you can stop to breathe in fresh air, taste local food, and learn about different cultures. These moments make journeys richer, and we live for those little surprises you find on road trips. With Duracabs, every road you take is the beginning of a beautiful story.</span></p>\n<h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; padding: -6pt 0pt 4pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.999999999999998pt; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; color: #434343; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">About Car Rental In Agra</span></h3>\n<h2><strong style=\"font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;</strong></h2>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Agra is a city located in Uttar Pradesh. It is situated on the banks of the river Yamuna. Agra is primarily known for being home to the beautiful Taj Mahal, one of the most famous and recognizable monuments in the world. And it is also one of the seven wonders of the world which is visited by a lot of tourist from different corners of world. Apart from the Taj Mahal, Agra is also known for other Mughal-era monuments like the Agra Fort , Sikandra fort and Fatehpur Sikri. Agra is also known for its rich cultural heritage, including handicrafts, dance, and its delicious cuisine, which features a mix of Mughlai and regional dishes. Also you will get to know a lot of delicious Street foods available in the local markets and streets of Agra.</span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; padding: -6pt 0pt 4pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.999999999999998pt; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; color: #434343; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">How to Book Cab with Duracabs</span></h3>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Booking a cab is a very easy process. You can book any cab very easily through online mode. For booking a cab service with Duracabs you have to follow some very simple steps.</span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">●Visit the Duracabs website- first you have to visit coefficient website of Duracabs.</span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">● Sign up or log in - talk to visit in the website you will get a page which will ask you do sign up or login with your phone number or email id. There you have to enter your phone number or email ID for entering the website.</span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margi