\/pages\\/car-rental-in-basti\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Bathinda\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-in-bathinda\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Bharatpur\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-in-bharatpur\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Chittorghar\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-chittorgarh\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Churu\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-churu\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Dausa\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-dausa\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Dehradun\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-dehradun\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Delhi\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-delhi\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Deoria\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-deoria\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Agra to Delhi (OneWay Taxi) Sedan\",\"oneway\":\"2519\",\"perKM\":\"9\"},{\"name\":\"Agra to Delhi (OneWay Taxi) SUV\",\"oneway\":\"3800\",\"perKM\":\"14\"}]'),(117,'2005-11-24 05:45:00','2025-09-25 01:20:28','Same Day Agra Tour Packages From Delhi',112,'same-day-agra-tour-packages-from-delhi','<h1>Agra Tour Package from Delhi One Day Trip | Book Car Rental Service for Same Day Agra Tour from Delhi</h1><p>Agra is one of the most historical cities of India where the Taj Mahal, one of the seven wonders, is located. Many tourists come every day to visit Agra. DuraCabs provides Delhi to Agra tour packages, in which you will get the entire journey from Delhi to Agra by cab. They also have other tour packages like Agra tour and Agra sightseeing tour. Many tourists do not know much about Agra and hence they can take the help of tour packages from DuraCabs and easily tour the city. For more information you can contact DuraCabs contact number or their email id: Contact Number: +917088873332. Email ID: info@duracabs.com</p><h3>One Day Agra Tour Package from Delhi by Car</h3><p>Duracabs company provides same day Agra tour packages to their customers. This same day tour package is best for those tourists who are visiting Agra for the first time and those also from Delhi.</p><p>Agra trip from Delhi will be very comfortable and enjoyable through Duracabs. They provide these tour packages at affordable prices and with the best option of various cars that you can choose for the trip.</p><h3>Why Choose Duracabs for Same Day Agra Tour Package from Delhi?</h3><p>Are You Planning a Same-Day Tour of Agra from Delhi? It will make it all worthwhile to choose a suitable travel partner, and Duracabs ensures an exciting, safe, and luxurious trip.</p><p><strong>Travelers prefer Duracabs for the following reasons:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Wide Range of Cars to Suit Your Needs - </strong>Whether you\'re travelling solo, with family, friends, or a small group, you can book the ideal car. From compact sedans for couples to spacious 7-8 seater SUVs or luxury cars for group travel, we have options for every type of traveler. You get the freedom to choose what suits your comfort and budget.</li><li><strong>Professional &amp; Experienced Drivers - </strong>They are well-versed with the Delhi-Agra route, ensuring timely pickups, smooth navigation, and hassle-free travel. Our drivers are also familiar with Agra’s local attractions, so they can guide you to the best sightseeing spots efficiently.</li><li><strong>Well-Maintained &amp; Comfortable Vehicles - </strong>You can expect clean interiors, spacious seating, air conditioning, and ample legroom for a relaxing journey. Our focus is to deliver both reliability and comfort throughout your trip.</li><li><strong>Assistance with Best Local Dining Options - </strong>Whether you want to enjoy a hygienic family restaurant, authentic local cuisine, or quick refreshments, our drivers will suggest reliable and popular eateries.&nbsp;</li><li><strong>Complete Sightseeing Coverage -</strong> From the majestic <strong>Taj Mahal</strong>, <strong>Agra Fort</strong>, to <strong>Mehtab Bagh</strong> and <strong>local markets</strong>, our flexible tour plan allows you to make the most of your day without the stress of public transport or fixed schedules.</li><li><strong>Hassle-Free Booking &amp; Transparent Pricing - </strong>You can book online or via a simple phone call. Our pricing structure is competitive, with no hidden charges. You only pay for what you book, with complete clarity.</li><li><strong>Comfortable Return to Delhi Same Day - </strong>After exploring Agra, our drivers will safely drop you back to your preferred location in Delhi, ensuring a convenient end to your memorable trip.</li></ul><h3><strong>Must-Visit Places in Agra :</strong></h3><ol><li><strong>The Taj Mahal</strong> - Emperor Shah Jahan built this marvel of white marble in memory of his beloved wife, Mumtaz Mahal. It is an affirmation to his artistic genius and everlasting loyalty.</li><li><strong>Agra Fort - </strong>The main circuit residence of the Mughal rulers was the magnificent red sandstone castle known as Agra Fort. Inside its magnificent walls, discover its palaces, courtyards, and rich past.</li><li><strong>Tomb of Itimad-Ud-Daulah (Also known as Baby Taj) - </strong>This gorgeous marble mausoleum, which is often viewed as a prototype of the Taj Mahal, is prized for its beautiful inlay work, elaborate sculptures, and serene surrounds.</li><li><strong>The Tomb of Akbar, Sikandra - </strong>Akbar\'s Tomb, the ultimate burial place of the famous Mughal Emperor Akbar, is situated outside of Agra.</li><li><strong>Mehtab Bagh - </strong>The ideal sunset view of the Taj Mahal may be had from this verdant garden located across the Yamuna River.</li></ol><h2>FAQs – Agra to Delhi Cab Services</h2><h3>Q1: What is the distance between Agra and Delhi by cab?</h3><p>Ans: The distance between Agra and Delhi by cab is approximately <strong>230 kilometers</strong>, depending on your pickup and drop locations. The journey typically takes around <strong>3.5 to 5 hours</strong>, depending on traffic and route.</p><h3>Q2: Can I choose the pick-up and drop location in Delhi?</h3><p>Ans: Yes, with Duracabs you can choose any preferred pick-up and drop-off location within Delhi/NCR including your home, hotel, or airport.</p><h3>Q3: Do you provide tour guides for the Taj Mahal and Agra Fort?</h3><p>Ans: Yes, upon request, we can arrange professional and government-approved English or Hindi-speaking tour guides for an additional cost.</p><h3>Q4: What is the best time to start the tour from Delhi?</h3><p>Ans: We recommend starting your journey between <strong>5:00 AM to 7:00 AM</strong> to make the most of the day and avoid city traffic.</p><h3>Q5: Is the Taj Mahal open every day?</h3><p>Ans: No, the <strong>Taj Mahal is closed every Friday</strong> for general public visits. Please plan your tour accordingly.</p><h3>Q6: Which car options are available for the same day tour?</h3><p>Ans: We offer a wide range of vehicles including Sedans (Dzire, Etios), SUVs (Innova, Ertiga, Crysta), and Tempo Travellers for larger groups.</p><h3>Q7: Are meals included in the tour package?</h3><p>Ans: Meals are not included by default, but we can arrange meal add-ons or stopovers at popular restaurants like The Oberoi Amarvilas or local food joints on request.</p><h3>Q8: Is the Same Day Agra Tour suitable for senior citizens or kids?</h3><p>Ans: Yes, the tour is comfortable and suitable for all age groups. Our cars are spacious and we ensure regular breaks during the journey.</p><h3>Q9: Can I customize my Same Day Agra itinerary?</h3><p>Ans: Absolutely! You can add or remove sightseeing spots such as Mehtab Bagh, Itimad-ud-Daulah, or Sikandra Tomb. We are happy to customize the itinerary for you.</p><h3>Q10: Is the entry fee for monuments included in the package?</h3><p>Ans: No, monument entry tickets are not included by default. However, we can assist you in purchasing online tickets in advance to save time.</p><h3>Q11: Do you offer same-day Agra tours for solo travelers or couples?</h3><p>Ans: Yes, we provide private tours ideal for solo travelers, couples, families, or even corporate groups with per-vehicle pricing for privacy and comfort.</p><h3>Q12: What safety measures does Duracabs follow?</h3><p>Ans: All our vehicles are regularly sanitized, and drivers follow COVID-appropriate behavior. Safety, hygiene, and customer satisfaction are our top priorities.</p><h3>Q13: How can I book the Same Day Agra Tour with Duracabs?</h3><p>Ans: You can book directly via our website<a href=\"https://www.duracabs.com/pages/same-day-agra-tour-packages-from-delhi\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"> </span></a>Duracabs call our customer support, or WhatsApp us for quick assistance.</p><h3>Q14: What is the cancellation or refund policy for this tour?</h3><p>Ans: You can cancel your tour up to <strong>24 hours before the scheduled time</strong> for a full refund. For last-minute cancellations, partial charges may apply.</p><p><br></p>','page',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Agra Tour Package from Delhi One(Same) Day By Car - Book Now!','Looking for a Agra Tour Package from Delhi One Day by cab? Book now with Duracabs and enjoy sightseeing Taj Mahal, Agra Fort, Mehtab Bagh - all in a single day!',NULL,'car rental delhi airport,car rental in delhi airport,delhi airport Car Rental,car rent delhi airport,car booking delhi airport,cab service in delhi airport,taxi service,taxi service in delhi airport,cab taxi service,cab taxi service near me,car rental agencies delhi airport,one way cab taxi,taxi cab online booking,car rental with driver,airport cab',NULL,NULL,NULL,'index,follow',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'WebPage',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Jaipur\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-in-jaipur\"},{\"name\":\"Car Rental In Agra\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.duracabs.com\\/pages\\/car-rental-agra\"},{