of the Taj Mahal, visit Mehtab Bagh, a garden across the Yamuna River. This serene spot offers a picturesque backdrop for photographs. Enjoy the tranquility and take a leisurely stroll around the garden with the convenience of your <strong>self-drive car rental Agra</strong>.</p><h2>Local Markets and Street Food</h2><p>Agra’s vibrant markets and delicious street food are not to be missed. Explore Sadar Bazaar and try local delicacies like petha and chaat. With a <strong>self-drive car in Agra</strong>, navigating the city’s bustling streets and discovering culinary delights becomes an enjoyable adventure.</p><h3>Tips for Driving in Agra</h3><p>Driving in Agra requires some preparation. Here are a few tips to ensure a smooth experience:</p><p>1.&nbsp; <strong>Understand Local Traffic Rules:</strong> Familiarize yourself with local traffic rules to navigate Agra’s roads confidently.</p><p>2.&nbsp; <strong>Utilize GPS Navigation:</strong> Use GPS navigation to avoid getting lost and to find your destinations easily.</p><p>3.&nbsp; <strong>Stay Alert:</strong> Traffic conditions can be unpredictable, so stay attentive and watch for pedestrians, cyclists, and other vehicles.</p><p>4.&nbsp; <strong>Plan Your Parking:</strong> Popular attractions may have limited parking. Plan ahead and use designated parking areas to avoid any inconvenience.</p><h2>Conclusion</h2><p>Choosing a <strong>self-drive car rental in Agra</strong> offers unparalleled freedom, flexibility, and convenience. With <strong>Dura Cabs Services</strong>, you can enjoy a seamless rental experience, complete with a diverse fleet of vehicles, competitive pricing, and excellent customer support. Whether you’re visiting the Taj Mahal, exploring historical sites, or discovering local cuisine, a <strong>self-drive car rental Agra</strong> allows you to tailor your journey to your preferences.</p><p>Embrace the freedom of the open road and make the most of your Agra adventure with a <strong>self-drive car rental