river. For this reason, they may choose to book a self-drive car rental, which does not include a driver. With this type of rental, individuals are responsible for operating the vehicle themselves.</p><h3>Airport pickup and drop</h3><p>airport pick up and drop rental cars and the most commonly booked ones. Usually people who are travelling to different city book a airport pick up or drop cab service.</p><h3>Taxi service for weddings</h3><p>People also book Online Taxi Booking In Delhi for wedding. To travel in a wedding it is very convenient to book multiple taxi and accommodate all the people.</p><h3>One Way Cab from delhi</h3><p>Many people were travelling to different sitting don\'t want cab service for multiple days. For this purpose you can go for one way cab service. Duracabs provides oneway cab service from delhi to different cities. If you\'re looking for a one-way cab from delhi, there are several options available. Some of the most popular one way cab services in Delhi include:</p><ul><li>Delhi to Agra one way Cab</li><li>Delhi to Noida one way Cab</li><li>Delhi to Mathura one way Cab</li><li>Delhi to Lucknow one way Cab</li><li>Delhi to Jaipur one way Cab</li></ul><p>All these one way services are very affordable and can be booked instantly for travelling. Most people who travel for official purpose book one way cab service.</p><h3>Types of Taxis available at DuraCabs</h3><p>Depending on your requirements, you can book a Toyota, a sedan or an SUV on any other type of taxi. There are different kinds of taxi list available on Duracabs website. Some of them include</p><p>SUV, Ertiga, and Innova. You can also check out the rating of each cab before booking and then book accordingly. Also, you can see the picture of each car.</p><p>Sedan (Xcent, Amaze etc.) - people going with the small group generally book a sedan for their comfortable travelling and affordable price.</p><p>SUV (Xylo, Ertiga etc.) An SUV has approx 7 to 8 passenger capacity and give you a very comfortable and smooth journey.</p><p>Dzire/Etios - it is a premier can with 4 to 5 passenger capacity and generally book for small family trip.</p><p>Toyota Innova - choice of most of the customers is Toyota Innova it is a affordable and gives a great mileage also has more passenger capacity and is spacious.</p><h3>How to Book Cab with Duracabs</h3><p>Booking a cab is a very easy process. You can book any cab very easily through online mode. For booking a cab service with Duracabs you have to follow some very simple steps.</p><p>●Visit the Duracabs website- first you have to visit coefficient website of Duracabs.</p><p>● Sign up or log in - talk to visit in the website you will get a page which will ask you do sign up or login with your phone number or email id. There you have to enter your phone number or email ID for entering the website.</p><p>● Enter your pickup location and drop location - for getting your cab booked first you have to enter your pick up and drop location.</p><p>● Select the type of cab- you will get a lot of options of cabs available from there you have to choose one of your choice.</p><p>● Select your travel date and time - then you have to select the date and time that is the duration of your travelling.</p><p>● Make the payment using your preferred payment method - after choosing a cab and entering the date and time you can do the payment you will get a lot of options of doing payment you can choose your preferred method.</p><p>● You will receive a confirmation message- after the payment is done you will receive a confirmation message you have to keep that with you.</p><p>● Driver picks you up from your location- on the day your choice starts the driver will pick you up from my location.</p><h3>About Delhi</h3><p>Delhi is the capital city of India and is located in the northern part of the country. Delhi is known for its diverse cuisine, historical landmarks, and vibrant nightlife. Some of the major tourist attractions in Delhi include the Red Fort, Qutub Minar, Humayun\'s Tomb, India Gate, Lotus Temple, and Akshardham Temple. The city is also famous for its street food, which includes dishes like chaat, chole bhature, and parathas.</p><h3>Places to Visit in Delhi Private Cab</h3><p>Delhi has a rich history and has been an important city for several empires and kingdoms Here are some of the most popular tourist attractions in Delhi that you can visit:</p><p><strong><br>Red Fort<br></strong><br></p><p>The Red Fort, also known as Lal Qila, is a historic fortification located in Old Delhi, India. It was built by Mughal Emperor Shah Jahan in the mid-17th century and served as the residence of the Mughal Emperors until 1857. The fort is known for its distinctive red sandstone walls and intricate architecture, including the Diwan-i-Aam and Diwan-i-Khas, two grand halls used for public and private audiences. Today, the Red Fort is a UNESCO World Heritage Site and a popular tourist destination.</p><p><strong><br>India Gate<br></strong><br></p><p>India Gate is a war memorial located in the heart of New Delhi, India. It was built to honor the Indian soldiers who died during World War I and the Afghan Wars. The structure is 42 meters tall and was designed by Edwin Lutyens. The names of more than 13,000 soldiers are inscribed on the gate. India Gate is also a popular picnic spot and tourist attraction, with its beautiful gardens and fountain. The gate is lit up every evening, providing a beautiful sight for visitors.</p><p><strong><br>Lotus Temple<br></strong><br></p><p>The Lotus Temple is a Bahá\'í House of Worship located in Delhi, India. Built in 1986, it is known for its distinctive lotus-shaped design and serves as a place of worship for people of all religions. The temple is surrounded by nine pools of water, which are said to represent the nine unifying spiritual paths of the Bahá\'í faith. The temple has won numerous architectural awards and has become a popular tourist attraction, with over four million visitors annually.</p><p><strong><br>Akshardham Temple<br></strong><br></p><p>Akshardham Temple is a Hindu temple complex located in Delhi, India. It was inaugurated in 2005 and is spread over an area of 100 acres. The temple\'s architecture is inspired by ancient Hindu scriptures and features intricate carvings and designs. The complex includes a main temple, an exhibition on Indian culture and history, a musical fountain show, and gardens. It is one of the largest Hindu temples in the world and attracts millions of visitors each year. The temple is known for its grandeur and spiritual significance.</p><p><strong><br>Qutub Minar<br></strong><br></p><p>Qutub Minar is a tall minaret located in Delhi, India. It was built in the 12th century by Qutb-ud-din Aibak, the first Muslim ruler of Delhi. The tower is 73 meters high and is made of red sandstone and marble. It has five stories and is decorated with intricate carvings and inscriptions. Qutub Minar is a UNESCO World Heritage Site and is one of the most popular tourist attractions in Delhi.</p><p><strong><br>Humayun\'s Tomb<br></strong><br></p><p>Humayun\'s Tomb is a mausoleum located in Delhi, India. It was built in the mid-16th century and is the tomb of Mughal Emperor Humayun. The tomb is an excellent example of Mughal architecture, characterized by its red sandstone and white marble construction and intricate decorative elements. It also features a large garden complex with pools and fountains. The tomb has been designated as a UNESCO World Heritage Site and is a popular tourist destination in Delhi.</p><p><br></p>','page',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Delhi Taxi Service | One Way & Outstation Cab Booking','Popular Taxi Services in Delhi | Hire Outstation & Airport Cabs Book the most affordable Taxi Services in Delhi for airport transfers and long-distance rides, with real-time pricing, driver ratings, and cashless payments.',NULL,'car rental delhi airport,car rental in delhi airport,delhi airport Car Rental,car r