to follow some very simple steps.</p><p>●Visit the Duracabs website- first you have to visit coefficient website of Duracabs.</p><p>● Sign up or log in - talk to visit in the website you will get a page which will ask you do sign up or login with your phone number or email id. There you have to enter your phone number or email ID for entering the website.</p><p>● Enter your pickup location and drop location - for getting your cab booked first you have to enter your pick up and drop location.</p><p>● Select the type of cab- you will get a lot of options of cabs available from there you have to choose one of your choice.</p><p>● Select your travel date and time - then you have to select the date and time that is the duration of your travelling.</p><p>● Make the payment using your preferred payment method - after choosing a cab and entering the date and time you can do the payment you will get a lot of options of doing payment you can choose your preferred method.</p><p>● You will receive a confirmation message- after the payment is done you will receive a confirmation message you have to keep that with you.</p><p>● Driver picks you up from your location- on the day your choice starts the driver will pick you up from my location.</p><h3>About Haridwar</h3><p>Haridwar is a city located in the Indian state of Uttarakhand. It is one of the seven holiest places in Hinduism and is considered as the gateway to the Char Dham Yatra, which includes the four sacred Hindu pilgrimage sites of Yamunotri, Gangotri, Kedarnath, and Badrinath. The city is situated on the banks of the river Ganges and is surrounded by the Shivalik range of the Himalayas.</p><h3>Places to Visit in Haridwar Private Cab</h3><p>Haridwar is known for its rich cultural heritage and religious significance. The city is home to many ancient temples, ashrams, and ghats, which attract a large number of devotees and tourists every year. Some of the popular attractions in Haridwar include Har Ki Pauri, Mansa Devi Temple, Chandi Devi Temple, Maya Devi Temple, and Daksha Mahadev Temple.</p><p><strong><br>Har Ki Pauri<br></strong><br></p><p>Har Ki Pauri is a famous ghat on the banks of the River Ganges and is one of the most popular tourist places in Haridwar. It is believed to be the place where Lord Vishnu left his footprint, and thousands of devotees visit here every day to take a dip in the holy river.</p><p><strong><br>Chandi Devi Temple<br></strong><br></p><p>The Chandi Devi Temple is situated on top of Neel Parvat and is one of the most revered temples in Haridwar. The temple is dedicated to Goddess Chandi, and the scenic view of Haridwar from the top of the hill is breathtaking.</p><p><strong><br>Mansa Devi Temple<br></strong><br></p><p>The Mansa Devi Temple is situated on top of Bilwa Parvat and is dedicated to Goddess Mansa Devi, who is believed to fulfill the wishes of her devotees. The temple can be reached by a cable car ride, and the view of Haridwar from the top is mesmerizing.</p><p><strong><br>Maya Devi Temple<br></strong><br></p><p>The Maya Devi Temple is one of the oldest temples in Haridwar and is dedicated to Goddess Maya, who is believed to be an incarnation of Goddess Shakti. The temple is also known for its historical significance and architecture.</p><p><strong><br>Rajaji National Park<br></strong><br></p><p>The Rajaji National Park is situated on the outskirts of Haridwar and is a popular tourist place for nature lovers. The park is home to a wide range of flora and fauna, including tigers, leopards, elephants, and more.</p><p><br></p>','page',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Taxi Services in Haridwar Dura Cabs Rs.9km only','Dura cabs OffersCar Rental Haridwar services from Find our Best Rated Cab/Taxi Services in Haridwar for Outsation at low Price Rs.9/km. with driver.',NULL,'car rental delhi airport,car rental in delhi airport,delhi airport Car Rental,car rent delhi airport,car booking delhi airport,cab service in delhi airport,taxi service,taxi service in d