y car services from Agra to Chandigarh which are available on the websites. If you are looking for a hassle free way to reach Chandigarh from Agra, then it is best to book a cab online. You have found the Duracabs website, select a car as per your requirements, search for car services in your area, find a car that suits your budget and convenience, and book a cab To Chandigarh. Multiple cars are available for different category like SUV hatchback and sedan. You can find a suitable cab as per your budget and preference. Once you find a suitable service, all you have to do is book a cab, sit back, relax and enjoy the ride.</p><h2>Types of Cab Available for Agra to Chandigarh</h2><p>Depending on the type of cab service you hire, you can expect the ride To Chandigarh to be comfortable, or it can be very uncomfortable. You can expect Inova Crysta cabs to be the most comfortable, followed by suzuki and then Indica/Maruti . If you are on a budget and can\'t afford the luxury cab services, then the next best thing you can do is to book a cab with an AC cab or a Inova cab. It\'s best if you book a cab for Chandigarh that has AC on board, as Chandigarh has a very high temperature. You can choose a cab based on its price, the number of seats it has, the number of AC windows, and the number of doors it has.</p><h3>About Chandigarh</h3><p>Chandigarh is the home of the union and a planned megacity in northern India, which serves as the capital of the participating states of Punjab and Haryana. The distance from Agra to Chandigarh by road is 492 km. Chandigarh is bounded on the north, west, and south by the state of Punjab and on the east by the state of Haryana. It is a major part of the Chandigarh Capital Region or Greater Chandigarh, which also includes the nearby satellite cities of Panchkula and Mohali. It is located near the foothills of the Himalayas, 260 km (162 mi) north of New Delhi and 229 km (143 mi) southeast of Amritsar.</p><p><br></p>',NULL,NULL,1,0,1,1,'none','Agra