vance for cheapest prices.',NULL,NULL,1,1,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-13 06:24:33','2025-10-13 06:24:33'),(151,1,'with_driver','car',7,1,'Amritsar,Punjab To Agra,Uttar Pradesh','amritsar-punjab-to-agra-uttar-pradesh','seo_page','route','one_way',10799.00,12095.00,695.00,10.00,9.00,150.00,0.00,0.00,0.00,'[\"products\\/01JACF9VVJ6NR66H0XWR9XVVQQ.jpg\"]','<h1>Amritsar to Agra Cab/Taxi</h1><p>Agra is a beautiful tourist destination of India. There you can spend a good time with your family and friends. You can <strong>book a cab</strong> from <strong>Amritsar to Agra</strong> and explore its various tourist places. There are various private and public transport options that you can use to reach Agra. During the <strong>road trip</strong> from <strong>Amritsar to Agra</strong>, you experience beautiful landscapes. You can also <strong>book a cab/taxi from Amritsar airport to Agra</strong>. You can experience a comfortable and hassle free ride at an affordable price. If your starting point is Amritsar, you can avail <strong>cab services</strong> from <strong>Amritsar to Agra</strong>. To book a cab from <a href=\"https://www.duracabs.com/route/amritsar-punjab-to-agra-uttar-pradesh\"><strong>Amritsar to Agra</strong></a>, you can book a cab online at Dura Cabs.</p><h2>How to Book Amritsar To Agra Cab.</h2><p>Duracabs provides many <strong>car services from Amritsar To Agra</strong> which are available on our websites. If you are looking for a hassle free way to reach Agra from Amritsar, then it is <strong>best to book a cab online</strong>. You have found the Duracabs website, select a car as per your requirements, search for <strong>car services</strong> in your area, find a car that suits your budget and convenience, and book a cab To Agra. Multiple cars are available for different category like SUV hatchback and sedan. You can find a suitable cab as per your budget and preference. Once you find a suitable service, all you have to do is book a cab, sit back, relax and enjoy the ride.</p><h2>Types of Cab Available for Amritsar To Agra</h2><p>Depending on the type of <strong>cab service</strong> you hire, you can expect the ride to Agra to be comfortable, or it can be very uncomfortable. You can expect Inova Crysta cabs to be the most comfortable, followed by suzuki and then Indica/Maruti . If you are on a budget and can\'t afford the luxury cab services, then the next best thing you can do is to book a cab with an AC cab or a Inova cab. It\'s best if you <strong>book a cab for Agra</strong> that has AC on board, as Agra has a very good temperature. You can choose a cab based on its price, the number of seats it has, the number of AC windows, and the number of doors it has.</p><h3>About Agra</h3><p>Agra is a megacity on the banks of the Yamuna River in the Indian state of Uttar Pradesh, about 230 kilometers( 140 mi) southeast of the public capital Delhi and 330 km west of the state capital Lucknow. With a population of roughly 1.6 million, Agra is the fourth-most vibrant megacity in Uttar Pradesh and the twenty-third-most vibrant megacity in India.</p><p><br></p>',NULL,NULL,1,0,1,1,'none','Amritsar to Agra Cab/Taxi Hire Oneway Rs.10799','Hire Amritsar To Agra cab online at the best price. Duracabs provides the most affordable and reliable cab service on this route. Price starts at Rs.10799',NULL,NULL,1,1,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-13 06:24:33','2025-10-13 06:24:33'),(152,1,'with_driver','car',7,57,'Amritsar,Punjab To IGI(T1 Airport) New Delhi,Delhi','amritsar-punjab-to-igi-t1-airport-new-delhi-delhi','seo_page','route','one_way',5279.00,5912.00,498.00,9.00,9.00,150.00,0.00,0.00,0.00,'[\"products\\/01JACF9VVJ6NR66H0XWR9XVVQQ.jpg\"]','<b>Dura Cabs Services</b> is your complete car rental solution, offering local taxi services, outstation trips with a driver, and holiday tour packages across India. Within just a few years, Dura Cabs has established itself as India’s national chauffeur service, wi