 IGI(T1-Airport) one-way cab/taxi</strong> that has AC on board, asIGI(T1-Airport) has a very high temperature. You can choose a cab based on its price, the number of seats it has, the number of AC windows, and the number of doors it has.</p><h3>About IGI(T1-Airport)</h3><p>The Terminal 1-IGI Airport Metro Station is located on the Magenta Line of the Delhi Metro. It was part of Phase III of Delhi Metro. It was opened to the public on 29 May 2018.</p><p><strong>Quick Facts about Jaipur To IGI(T1-Airport)<br></strong><br></p><p><strong>Destination:</strong>Jaipur To IGI(T1-Airport)</p><p><strong>Jaipur To IGI(T1-Airport) Distance Oneway/One Side:</strong></p><p><strong>Route 1: </strong>4 hr 33 min (287.0 km) via NE 4</p><p><strong>Route 2: </strong>5 hr 12 min (252.0 km) via NH 48</p><p><br></p>',NULL,NULL,1,0,1,0,'none','IGI(T1 Airport) New Delhi,Delhi To Jaipur,Rajasthan','Dura cabs is the best rated AC cab services with driver Or without driver for North India. Book in advance for cheapest prices.',NULL,NULL,1,1,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-13 06:24:33','2025-10-13 06:24:33'),(603,1,'with_driver','car',57,64,'IGI(T1 Airport) New Delhi,Delhi To Jaisalmer,Rajasthan','igi-t1-airport-new-delhi-delhi-to-jaisalmer-rajasthan','seo_page','route','one_way',13790.00,15444.00,784.00,13.00,9.00,150.00,0.00,0.00,0.00,'[\"products\\/01JACF9VVJ6NR66H0XWR9XVVQQ.jpg\"]','<b>Dura Cabs Services</b> is your complete car rental solution, offering local taxi services, outstation trips with a driver, and holiday tour packages across India. Within just a few years, Dura Cabs has established itself as India’s national chauffeur service, with dedicated offices in every major city.\n\nWith a fleet of over 110,000 taxis operating in more than 390 cities, we offer various exciting packages for popular tourist and business destinations. Our user-friendly online portal lets customers check real-time taxi availability and make customized, itinerary-based bookings with ease. W