 budget and preference. Once you find a suitable service, all you have to do is <strong>book a cab</strong>, sit back, relax and enjoy the ride.</p><h2>Types of Cab Available for Manali, Himachal Pradesh To Agra</h2><p>Depending on the type of <strong>cab service</strong> you hire, you can expect the ride to Agra to be comfortable, or it can be very uncomfortable. You can expect Inova Crysta cabs to be the most comfortable, followed by suzuki and then Indica/Maruti . If you are on a budget and can\'t afford the luxury cab services, then the next best thing you can do is to book a cab with an AC cab or a Inova cab. It\'s best if you <strong>book a cab for Agra</strong> that has AC on board, as Agra has a very good temperature. You can choose a cab based on its price, the number of seats it has, the number of AC windows, and the number of doors it has.</p><h3>About Agra</h3><p>Agra is a megacity on the banks of the Yamuna River in the Indian state of Uttar Pradesh, about 230 kilometers( 140 mi) southeast of the public capital Delhi and 330 km west of the state capital Manali, Himachal Pradesh. With a population of roughly 1.6 million, Agra is the fourth-most vibrant megacity in Uttar Pradesh and the twenty-third-most vibrant megacity in India.</p><p><br></p>',NULL,NULL,1,0,1,1,'none','Manali to Agra Cab/Taxi Hire Oneway Rs.10799','Hire Manali To Agra cab online at the best price. Duracabs provides the most affordable and reliable cab service on this route. Price starts at Rs.10799',NULL,NULL,1,1,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-13 06:24:33','2025-10-13 06:24:33'),(1230,1,'with_driver','car',80,57,'Manali,Himachal Pradesh? To IGI(T1 Airport) New Delhi,Delhi','manali-himachal-pradesh-to-igi-t1-airport-new-delhi-delhi','seo_page','route','one_way',8279.00,9272.00,548.00,13.00,9.00,150.00,0.00,0.00,0.00,'[\"products\\/01JACF9VVJ6NR66H0XWR9XVVQQ.jpg\"]','<b>Dura Cabs Services</b> is your complete car rental solution, offering local taxi services, outstation 