,0.00,0.00,'[\"products\\/01JACF9VVJ6NR66H0XWR9XVVQQ.jpg\"]','<h1>Mathura to Agra Cab/Taxi</h1><p>Agra is a beautiful tourist destination of India. There you can spend a good time with your family and friends. You can <strong>book a cab</strong> from Mathura to Agra and explore its various tourist places. There are various private and public transport options that you can use to reach Agra. During the <strong>road trip</strong> from Mathura to Agra, you experience beautiful landscapes. You can also book a cab/taxi from Mathura airport to Agra. You can experience a comfortable and hassle free ride at an affordable price. If your starting point is Mathura , you can avail cab services from Mathura to Agra. To book a cab from <a href=\"https://www.duracabs.com/route/mathura-uttar-pradesh-to-agra-uttar-pradesh\"><strong>Mathura to Agra</strong></a>, you can book a cab online at <a href=\"https://www.duracabs.in/\"><strong>Duracabs Services</strong></a>.</p><h2>How to Book Mathura To Agra Cab.</h2><p>Duracabs provides many <strong>car services</strong> from <strong>Mathura To Agra</strong> which are available on our websites. If you are looking for a hassle free way to reach<strong> Agra from Mathura </strong>, then it is best to <strong>book a cab online</strong>. You have found the Duracabs website, select a car as per your requirements, search for <strong>car services</strong> in your area, find a car that suits your budget and convenience, and <strong>book a cab To Agra</strong>. Multiple cars are available for different category like SUV hatchback and sedan. You can find a suitable cab as per your budget and preference. Once you find a suitable service, all you have to do is book a cab, sit back, relax and enjoy the ride.</p><h2>Types of Cab Available for Mathura To Agra</h2><p>Depending on the type of <strong>cab service</strong> you hire, you can expect the ride to Agra to be comfortable, or it can be very uncomfortable. You can expect Inova Crysta cabs to be the most comfortable, followed by suzuki and then Indica/Maruti . If you are on a budget and can\'t afford the luxury cab services, then the next best thing you can do is to <strong>book a cab</strong> with an AC cab or a Inova cab. It\'s best if you <strong>book a cab for Agra</strong> that has AC on board, as Agra has a very good temperature. You can choose a cab based on its price, the number of seats it has, the number of AC windows, and the number of doors it has.</p><h3>About Agra</h3><p>Agra is a megacity on the banks of the Yamuna River in the Indian state of Uttar Pradesh, about 230 kilometers( 140 mi) southeast of the public capital Delhi and 330 km west of the state capital Mathura. With a population of roughly 1.6 million, Agra is the fourth-most vibrant megacity in Uttar Pradesh and the twenty-third-most vibrant megacity in India.</p><p><br></p>',NULL,NULL,1,0,1,1,'none','Mathura to Agra Cab/Taxi Hire Oneway Rs.8694','Hire Mathura To Agra cab online at the best price. Duracabs provides the most affordable and reliable cab service on this route. Price starts at Rs.8694',NULL,NULL,1,1,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-13 06:24:33','2025-10-13 06:24:33'),(1254,1,'with_driver','car',83,57,'Mathura,Uttar Pradesh To IGI(T1 Airport) New Delhi,Delhi','mathura-uttar-pradesh-to-igi-t1-airport-new-delhi-delhi','seo_page','route','one_way',2846.00,3187.00,162.00,2.00,9.00,150.00,0.00,0.00,0.00,'[\"products\\/01JACF9VVJ6NR66H0XWR9XVVQQ.jpg\"]','<b>Dura Cabs Services</b> is your complete car rental solution, offering local taxi services, outstation trips with a driver, and holiday tour packages across India. Within just a few years, Dura Cabs has established itself as India’s national chauffeur service, with dedicated offices in every major city.\n\nWith a fleet of over 110,000 taxis operating in more than 390 cities, we offer various exciting packages for popular tourist and business destinations. Our user-friendly online portal lets customers check real-ti