 budget prices. if you are looking to hire or planning a road trip from <strong>Mathura to Delhi</strong> by cab then you should start with Duracabs Because we are one of the most trusted and fastest growing companies in North India which is known for the best Oneway outstation cab services provider.</p><p>Our drivers are well-trained and experienced in the transport industry they are known to treat our customers in a good manner and understand how much Important to drive safely.</p><p>Our cabs are well-maintained and clean cabs you love to comfort during your whole journey and will also enjoy your complete trip with Duracabs</p><p>Booking process in Duracabs is very easy. You can just call Duracabs customer care and book your slot or you can visit our website to book the cabs.</p><p><strong>What types of Taxi services does Dura Cabs offer?</strong></p><p>1. Duracabs offers Outstation Car Rental</p><p>Road trips are loved by all so we do our best to make sure your trip becomes best and memorable. Outstation cars are most preferred as in this car you will be provided by chauffeur. You will also get a detailed guide to explore your destination like a local.Two flavours of outstation <a href=\"https://www.duracabs.com/pages/one-side-taxi-in-agra\"><strong>Car Rentals</strong></a> are provided by Duracabs:</p><p>2. Round trip car rental<br><br>3. One way car rental<br><br>Charges may vary according to per km.<br><br>4.Duracabs offer Local Car Rental</p><p>We have cabs that fit your needs in case you want to explore sites in a new city, go on a picnic, attend business meetings, or want to take the family out on shopping.</p><p>When you book a local taxi service you will be given choices among a few cars such as full day car rental for 8 hours, extended full day car rental for 12 hours, and half day car rental which will be for 4 hours.</p><p>In case you have booked the car for the whole day, you need not to worry about getting from place to place. The driver will pick you up from the given location. After your visit he will also drop you to the location you have provided.</p><p><br></p>',NULL,NULL,1,0,1,1,'none','Mathura to Delhi Cab/taxi Hire Oneway Rs.2846','Duracabs offer Mathura to Delhi with Dura Cab Oneway service 24x7.book now Mathura to Delhi Taxi online make journey comfortable with premium Cars at Rs.2846',NULL,NULL,1,1,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-13 06:24:33','2025-10-13 06:24:33'),(1260,1,'with_driver','car',83,96,'Mathura,Uttar Pradesh To PDDU Airport,Agra,Uttar Pradesh','mathura-uttar-pradesh-to-pddu-airport-agra-uttar-pradesh','seo_page','route','one_way',1869.00,1973.00,494.00,8.00,9.00,150.00,0.00,0.00,0.00,'[\"products\\/01JACF9VVJ6NR66H0XWR9XVVQQ.jpg\"]','<b>Dura Cabs Services</b> is your complete car rental solution, offering local taxi services, outstation trips with a driver, and holiday tour packages across India. Within just a few years, Dura Cabs has established itself as India’s national chauffeur service, with dedicated offices in every major city.\n\nWith a fleet of over 110,000 taxis operating in more than 390 cities, we offer various exciting packages for popular tourist and business destinations. Our user-friendly online portal lets customers check real-time taxi availability and make customized, itinerary-based bookings with ease. We specialize in one-way cab services in Agra, Delhi, Jaipur, Chandigarh, and Shimla.\n\n<h2>What to Expect from Dura Cabs</h2>\n\nAt Dura Cabs, we prioritize customer satisfaction with a friendly and helpful driver team, committed to making your journey enjoyable. Our drivers are well-trained, maintain a strict uniform code, and are equipped to drive any vehicle you choose. Plus, with online bookings, your journey can begin within minutes without any upfront payment.',NULL,NULL,1,0,1,0,'none','Mathura,Uttar Pradesh To PDDU Airport,Agra,Uttar Pradesh','Dura cabs is the best rated AC cab services with driver Or without driver for North India. Book in adva